{"text": "If you sneeze with your eyes open, your eyeballs pop out of your head. That's what every kid on the playground said. But eyes aren't corks. Six muscles hold each one in its socket, like ropes on a tent. And a sneeze isn't a hundred miles an hour. Scientists filmed it. About ten. Your eyes shut anyway, probably to keep germs out. You can sneeze with them open. It just looks cursed. The real danger is holding it in. A man in Scotland pinched his nose, shut his mouth, and tore his windpipe. His eyes were fine.", "spoken": "If you sneeze with your eyes open, your eyeballs pop out of your head. That's what every kid on the playground said. But eyes aren't corks. Six muscles hold each one in its socket, like ropes on a tent. And a sneeze isn't a hundred miles an hour. Scientists filmed it. About ten. Your eyes shut anyway, probably to keep germs out. You can sneeze with them open. It just looks cursed. The real danger is holding it in. A man in Scotland pinched his nose, shut his mouth, and tore his windpipe. His eyes were fine.", "words": [[0.046, 0.151, "If"], [0.197, 0.279, "you"], [0.395, 0.743, "sneeze"], [0.778, 0.917, "with"], [0.964, 1.08, "your"], [1.149, 1.358, "eyes"], [1.416, 1.834, "open,"], [1.962, 2.136, "your"], [2.218, 2.601, "eyeballs"], [2.67, 2.914, "pop"], [2.972, 3.077, "out"], [3.1, 3.158, "of"], [3.204, 3.309, "your"], [3.367, 3.762, "head."], [4.203, 4.458, "That's"], [4.493, 4.656, "what"], [4.725, 4.992, "every"], [5.039, 5.201, "kid"], [5.248, 5.306, "on"], [5.341, 5.41, "the"], [5.445, 5.944, "playground"], [6.014, 6.432, "said."], [6.815, 7.024, "But"], [7.094, 7.465, "eyes"], [7.546, 7.779, "aren't"], [7.86, 8.533, "corks."], [8.916, 9.242, "Six"], [9.358, 9.752, "muscles"], [9.799, 10.008, "hold"], [10.124, 10.379, "each"], [10.449, 10.612, "one"], [10.646, 10.704, "in"], [10.762, 10.867, "its"], [10.902, 11.494, "socket,"], [11.738, 11.923, "like"], [11.993, 12.249, "ropes"], [12.295, 12.365, "on"], [12.411, 12.446, "a"], [12.504